============================================================
GoPro Controller — Dual Camera Support
============================================================

To use both cameras simultaneously, connect BOTH via USB-C.
Each USB connection gets its own IP in the 172.2x.1xx.51 range.

Quick-check what cameras are visible:
  GET http://localhost:5000/api/scan

Control individual cameras:
  GET  http://localhost:5000/api/1/status
  GET  http://localhost:5000/api/2/status
  POST http://localhost:5000/api/1/stream/start
  POST http://localhost:5000/api/2/stream/start

HLS streams (after starting):
  /static/hls/cam1/stream.m3u8
  /static/hls/cam2/stream.m3u8

Then open http://localhost:5000 in your browser
